/E (Thadomal Shahani Engineering College \(TSEC\) is a private engineering college in Mumbai, India. Founded in 1983, it is the first and oldest private engineering institute affiliated with the University of Mumbai. TSEC was founded by the Hyderabad \(Sind\) National Collegiate Board \(HSNC Board\) in 1983. It is named after one of Mumbai's most respected philanthropists, Dada Kishinchand T. Shahani's father, Thadomal Shahani.)
